[
  {
    "content_id": "10053001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保罗同西拉和提摩太写信给帖撒罗尼迦属于我们父上帝和主耶稣基督的教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿我们的父上帝和主耶稣基督赐给你们恩典和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，我们应当常常为你们感谢上帝，这是合宜的，因为你们的信心不断增长，彼此相爱的心也不断增加。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因此，我们在上帝的众教会中夸奖你们在各种迫害和患难中的坚忍和信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们这种表现正是上帝公义审判的明证，使你们配进上帝的国，你们正在为这国受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;上帝是公义的，祂必以患难来报应那些迫害你们的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;当主耶稣和祂大能的天使在烈焰中从天上显现时，祂必使你们这些受苦的人和我们同得安慰，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;惩罚那些不认识上帝、不听从有关我们主耶稣之福音的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那些人要受的刑罚就是离开主的面和祂荣耀的权能，永远灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;主降临的那日，祂要在祂的众圣徒中得到荣耀，使所有的信徒惊叹不已。你们也会在当中，因为你们相信了我们做的见证。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因此，我们常常为你们祷告，愿我们的上帝看你们配得祂的呼召，用大能成全你们一切美好的心愿和凭信心所做的工作。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这样，按照我们的上帝和主耶稣基督所赐的恩典，主耶稣基督的名便在你们身上得到荣耀，你们也在祂身上得到荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，关于主耶稣基督再来和我们到祂那里相聚的事情，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我们现在奉劝你们：无论是什么灵，或是传闻，或是冒充我们写的信，说主的日子已经到了，你们都不要轻易动摇，也不要惊慌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;不管别人用什么诡计，你们都不要上当。因为那日子来临之前，必有离经叛道的事发生，而那不法之徒，就是那注定灭亡的人也要出现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他会抵挡主，高抬自己超过一切所谓的神明和人们崇拜的对象，甚至坐在上帝的殿中以上帝自居！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我还在你们那里的时候，曾告诉过你们这些事，你们忘记了吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;现在，你们知道是什么拦阻他，使他到了所定的时间才出现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;其实那不法之徒的阴谋已经在酝酿中，然而现在有一位在拦阻他。等到拦阻他的那位一离开，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;他就会出现，但主耶稣会用自己口中的气毁灭他，用从天降临的荣光废掉他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他来要按照撒旦的伎俩行各种虚假的异能、神迹和奇事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;用尽各种诡计欺骗那些将要灭亡的人，因为他们不喜欢接受那能拯救他们的真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;上帝就让他们是非不辨，去相信那些虚假的谎言，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;使一切不相信真理、反喜爱不义的人都被定罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;主所爱的弟兄姊妹，我们应当常常为你们感谢上帝，因为上帝一开始就拣选了你们，使你们借着圣灵得以圣洁，并且相信真理，从而得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;为此，上帝借着我们所传的福音呼召了你们，使你们可以得到我们主耶稣基督的荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;所以，各位弟兄姊妹，务要坚定不移，无论是我们信上的教导还是口头的教导，你们都要坚守。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;愿主耶稣基督和爱我们、开恩将永远的安慰和美好的盼望赐给我们的父上帝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;安慰你们的心，使你们在一切善行善言上刚强。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，最后我还要请你们为我们祷告，好使主的道像在你们那里一样迅速传开、受到尊崇，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;并使我们能避开那些邪恶的人，因为不是人人都有信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;主是信实的，祂必使你们刚强，保护你们脱离那恶者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我们靠着主深信你们正遵行我们的吩咐，而且以后还会继续遵行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;愿主引导你们的心领悟上帝的爱和基督的坚忍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，现在我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐你们，要远离那些游手好闲、不遵守我们教导的信徒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们自己知道应该怎样效法我们，因为我们在你们那里的时候，并没有懒懒散散，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;也没有白吃谁的饭，而是昼夜辛勤工作，免得成为你们任何人的负担。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;这并不是因为我们没有权利接受供应，而是要给你们树立学习的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我们在你们那里的时候，曾吩咐过你们：不肯工作的人没有资格吃饭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我们听说在你们当中有些人游手好闲，无所事事，专管闲事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐并劝诫这些人要安分守己，自食其力。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄姊妹，你们要坚持行善，不要灰心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;如果有人不听从这信上的教导，要注意提防他，不要和他来往，好使他羞愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;只是不可把他当作仇人，要像对待弟兄姊妹一样劝诫他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;愿平安之主随时随地亲自赐你们平安！愿主与你们同在！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我保罗在这里亲笔问候你们，这是我的笔迹，我所有的信都以此为记号。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10053003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "帖撒罗尼迦后书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "53003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;愿我们主耶稣基督的恩典与你们众人同在！</p>"
  }
]